<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Day ${day} — 30-Day Terraform Challenge</title>
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg: #0d1117;
      --surface: #161b22;
      --border: #30363d;
      --text: #e6edf3;
      --muted: #8b949e;
      --accent: #79c0ff;
      --green: #3fb950;
      --blue: #1f6feb;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .container { max-width: 640px; width: 100%; }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    .day-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.3rem 1rem;
      border-radius: 20px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .env-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: ${environment == "production" ? "#3fb950" : environment == "staging" ? "#d29922" : "#1f6feb"};
      color: ${environment == "production" ? "#0d1117" : environment == "staging" ? "#0d1117" : "#fff"};
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-left: 8px;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .stat-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .stat label { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }
    .stat value { font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--accent); }
    .stack-list { list-style: none; }
    .stack-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }
    .stack-list li::before {
      content: "→";
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .code-block {
      background: #0d1117;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 1rem;
      font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="day-badge">
        🚀 Day ${day}
      </div>
      <h1>
        Static Website on S3 + CloudFront
        <span class="env-badge">${environment}</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        Deployed with Terraform — Infrastructure as Code in action.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">📊 Deployment Details</div>
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat">
          <label>Bucket Name</label>
          <value>${bucket_name}</value>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <label>Environment</label>
          <value>${environment}</value>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">🏗️ Architecture Stack</div>
      <ul class="stack-list">
        <li>S3 bucket for static content storage</li>
        <li>CloudFront CDN for global edge distribution</li>
        <li>Origin Access Identity (OAI) for secure access</li>
        <li>Website configuration with index/error documents</li>
        <li>Terraform-managed infrastructure as code</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">💡 Key Features</div>
      <ul class="stack-list">
        <li><strong>Global CDN:</strong> Content cached at 600+ edge locations</li>
        <li><strong>Security:</strong> S3 blocks all public access; only CloudFront can read</li>
        <li><strong>Static Hosting:</strong> Automatic index document serving at root</li>
        <li><strong>Cost Efficient:</strong> No compute; pay only for storage + transfer</li>
        <li><strong>Scalable:</strong> Handles millions of requests per second</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title">🔄 Invalidate Cache (After Updates)</div>
      <div class="code-block">
        aws cloudfront create-invalidation \
          --distribution-id YOUR_DIST_ID \
          --paths '/*'
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>✅ Successfully deployed with Terraform — Day ${day} Challenge</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted);">
        Part of the 30-Day Terraform Challenge
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
